{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777272449651","title":"Local model membantu belajar integrasi tanpa vendor noise","desc":"Local model memperbolehkan fokus pada arsitektur integrasi, bukan auth/billing/provider.","updated":1777362938335,"created":1777272449633,"tags":["zettel","ai","the-developers-guide-to-ai","chapter-2"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777272449651","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"c8868833adcdf0e45234ac586056e25a","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449651","id":"zettel.1777272449651","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449651","id":"zettel.1777272449651","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449651","id":"zettel.1777272449651","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449651","id":"zettel.1777272449651","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.chapter-2","alias":"chapter-2","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.chapter-2"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449651","id":"zettel.1777272449651","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":1220},"end":{"line":24,"column":51,"offset":1268},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449651","id":"zettel.1777272449651","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":3,"offset":1271},"end":{"line":25,"column":48,"offset":1316},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449652","id":"zettel.1777272449652","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":3,"offset":1801},"end":{"line":34,"column":27,"offset":1825},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449651"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.1777362905431","id":"zettel.1777362905431","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":3,"offset":1929},"end":{"line":36,"column":27,"offset":1953},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449651"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","id":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":1656},"end":{"line":24,"column":27,"offset":1680},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449651"}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"quote-baseline":{"type":"header","text":"Quote baseline","value":"quote-baseline","line":19,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-core":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini core","value":"kenapa-ini-core","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":27,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":34,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"local-model-membantu-belajar-integrasi-tanpa-vendor-noise\">Local model membantu belajar integrasi tanpa vendor noise<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#local-model-membantu-belajar-integrasi-tanpa-vendor-noise\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Yang gue tangkap dari quote ini adalah bahwa buku sengaja memisahkan \"belajar integrasi LLM\" dari kompleksitas provider komersial. Local Llama dipilih sebagai media pembelajaran karena dia membuat fokus tetap pada arsitektur request/response, streaming, dan UX—bukan pada auth, billing, atau quirks vendor.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quote-baseline\">Quote baseline<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#quote-baseline\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You will do the same, but using a locally running Llama instance.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-core\">Kenapa ini core<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-core\"></a></h2>\n<p>Quote ini penting karena dia mengandung keputusan pedagogis dan arsitektural: buku memilih jalur lokal untuk memperkenalkan pola dasar LLM integration, bukan untuk membahas provider-specific details. Ini menjelaskan kenapa latihan awal di chapter ini dirancang agar learning path-nya lebih bersih dan lebih developer-first.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Local model di chapter awal bukan klaim bahwa itu pilihan production terbaik, tapi pilihan belajar terbaik.</li>\n<li>Pendekatan ini mengurangi friction awal: nggak perlu mikir API key, quota, billing, atau network dependency.</li>\n<li>Ini membantu pembaca menangkap bahwa inti aplikasi AI adalah pola integrasi LLM, bukan vendor tertentu.</li>\n<li>Model/provider bisa diganti nanti—yang penting adalah arsitektur yang dipelajari terlebih dulu.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Chapter 2</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">chapter-2 (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449652\">Streaming token dapat diubah jadi UX responsif</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777362905431\">Grounding adalah menyuplai konteks yang hilang saat inference tanpa mengubah model</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">MOC The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpe